{
 "url": "https://dy8q0bnq8y.feishu.cn/wiki/Tz2pwvxTyiBK0zkCVszcZmJ3nwd",
 "title": "如何写论文-Abstract - 飞书云文档",
 "blocks": {
  "2": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">基本思路</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "3": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">论文摘要并非“论文简介”，而更应被视为一份</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">贡献说明书（statement of contribution）</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">。其目标不是全面概述论文内容，而是在有限篇幅内，使审稿人清晰地理解：</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">本文解决了什么问题、提出了什么关键思想、以及这些贡献对领域的意义何在</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">。因此，摘要不宜冗长，而应高度凝练、逻辑清晰。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "4": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "5": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">五句话原则</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "6": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">在一般情况下，摘要可以遵循下面的 </span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">“五句话原则”</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">，对应五个核心要素：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "7": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">任务背景(Context)-- 1句话</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "8": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">用最精炼的语言描述论文的大方向与任务范畴，使审稿人能够在第一时间判断论文所属领域以及所关注的核心问题。不要铺垫过多常识，直接切入主题。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "9": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">科学问题(Problem)--1-2句</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">（最关键）</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "10": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">这是比方法还要关键的部分，要讲出来现有研究的挑战与痛点</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "11": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">理想情况下，这里要是一个“结构性问题”而不是一个“经验现象”，或者从经验现象出发，总结出来的结构性问题。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "12": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">比如，LLMs often fail in xxxx task，这就属于经验现象，给人一种修修补补、贡献不大的感觉，一下子就掉到了boarline区域。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "13": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">要给出一些更加本质的问题，从现象上升到机理，比如是理论有缺陷，泛化能力弱，还是稳健性不足？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "14": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">方法创新(Methodology)--1-2句</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "15": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">提出核心的解决方案，要尽可能的凝练出思想，不要堆太多细节，比如要解决稳健性弱的问题，是通过什么方法解决的，提出了新的架构？新的损失？还是新的数据合成方法？核心的思想是什么？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "16": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">关键在于让审稿人理解“为什么这种方法在逻辑上能够解决前述问题”</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "17": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">结论与贡献(Results)--1句</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "18": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">实验描述应以</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">具体、可量化的指标</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">为主，而非泛泛而谈；很多同学喜欢直接写一句significant performance improvement，这种写法就很普通，因为所有的论文都可以这么写。反之，明确指出在多少个数据集、对比了哪些代表性方法，以及在什么指标上取得了多大幅度的提升，会更具说服力。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "19": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">另外有一点非常重要但是经常被忽略的，</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">实验结论应当与前文提出的科学问题形成明确呼应与逻辑闭环</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">，比如，如果论文声称解决的是稳健性不足的问题，那么实验中就应突出在何种干扰或变化下，本文方法相较于现有方法提升了多少稳健性；相比之下，仅报告整体 accuracy 往往不足以支撑核心 claim。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "20": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">优秀案例</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "21": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">下面这个例子取自论文Train for theWorst, Plan for the Best: Understanding Token Ordering in Masked Diffusions（ICML 2025 Outstanding Paper)，是一个从问题分析出发提出算法的文章。问题部分非常明确和本质“trade off complexity at training time with flexibility at inference time\"，结论部分，非常有说服力：from 7% to 90%，超越了7倍参数量的模型</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
